## Navigation bar

- Floating pill bar: background `#F9F6F3`, height 70, fully rounded, horizontal padding 10. Shadow `0, 8` blur 12 at about 20% `#959DA5`.
- Five icon tabs, no labels. Selected tab is a 48 circle in `#B59779` with a `#F9F6F3` icon. Unselected icons are `#8F8F91` at 24×24.
- Sit the pill above the bottom safe area with a small gap. Do not draw a full-width bar into the safe area.

