## General

- Prefer **cleaner, minimal APIs**: one `task` (or similar) argument instead of many separate fields when the widget is “one item” of that type.
- **Mini-games** live in the local package **`packages/kingo_games`**. Add new games under `lib/src/<game_name>/`, export them from `lib/kingo_games.dart`, and keep a thin app screen in `lib/features/games/` that wires translations/navigation.
- Add new conventions or instructions to this file so future changes stay consistent.
